message: "If you use this framework, please cite it as below."
title: "Cognitive Version Control: Fact, Concept, and Assumption Ledgers for Long LLM Conversations"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A lightweight specification and prompt toolkit for reducing premature
  convergence and belief-revision failure in long LLM conversations.
  It combines three ledgers (facts, concepts, assumptions), conversation
  forking, and three measurable metrics.
